codex
STEP 0 supports a Track B build, not Track A: the paper’s native extraction task is SMT-solvable and NP-complete in general, but this generator’s structured affine-XOR distribution has a polynomial GF(2) elimination algorithm. At the shipping size the compact recurrence is short enough to fit the no-tool cap, while the mechanical elimination route is large. I found a substantial existing draft in the workspace, so I’m auditing it rather than discarding user-visible work.
