codex
I found one real audit issue and am fixing it: the draft’s canonical key handled feature/tree order but not the family’s natural change-of-basis symmetry on the public \(\mathbb F_2^d\) tags. I’m replacing it with a relabelling-invariant signed-incidence refinement and expanding G8 to test each symmetry separately and in composition. The oracle rerun itself is externally blocked—OpenRouter again returned HTTP 403 before any valid attempt—so I will preserve that as an explicit limitation, not a false hardness result.
