Implemented a provisional Track B problem generator based on the paper’s Section 6, Theorem 1 reduction. The family inverse-generates affine-XOR constraints, compiles them into Boolean decision-tree ensembles, and checks witnesses through exact tree evaluation and majority voting. [Paper](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2010.08281)

