| G9(c) | pass | 129 serialized characters, at most 129 tokens, 127 atoms, 120 intended XORs |

The failing G6 panel was: feature/tag degree outlier (15,240 operations), one-sweep greedy repair (650,240), 256 random restarts per seed (2,048 total candidates), and the direct right-side-majority ansatz (15,240). Each recorded 0/8 successes. The successful reference algorithm is deliberately outside `attacks`, as Track B requires.

## Oracle and G9 diagnostics

The main hardener stopped before completing its first `easy` attempt set. These are API errors, not unsolved answers:

| Preset | Seed | Model | Result | Why |
|---|---:|---|---|---|
| easy | 2041307396 | Gemini 3.1 Pro Preview | error | HTTP 403 key limit |
| easy | 1224334167 | Gemini 3.1 Pro Preview | error | HTTP 403 key limit |
| easy | 523275990 | Gemini 3.1 Pro Preview | error | HTTP 403 key limit |
| easy | 1263091220 | Gemini 3.1 Pro Preview | error | HTTP 403 key limit |

| G9 arm | Solved/valid attempts | API errors | Verdict |
|---|---:|---:|---|
| bare | 0/0 | 4 | unmeasured |
| structural hint | 0/0 | 4 | unmeasured |
| placebo hint | 0/0 | 4 | unmeasured |

Consequently `hinted − placebo` is not statistically defined; the report stores `0.0` only because both attempt denominators are zero. No conclusion about the usefulness of the stated change-of-variables hint is justified. Re-run all three arms after restoring OpenRouter quota.

