-polynomial is sampled first.  Its values on nonzero points of F_2^d form the
-adversarial input, and affine-cocycle identities are compiled into 3-XOR
-gadgets, four clause trees per gadget.  The planted polynomial is therefore
-known by construction; make_instance never solves its output.
