383:\subsection{Tree Embedding Algorithm for Black-box Settings}\label{sec:blackbox}
385:The first algorithm is for black-box settings, where ``black-box'' is in the sense that the operator has no access to the training algorithm but can view the trained model. Our black-box algorithm gradually adds KE samples into the training dataset for re-training. 
