The \vcriterion\ is also followed precisely on tree ensembles, i.e., $acc(\kappa(M),\kappa D_{test})$ are all 1.0 in Table~\ref{table_forest}. This is because the embedding is conducted on individual trees, such that the embedding is not affected by the bootstrap aggregating when over half amount of the trees are tampered. 


