codex
The final paper-level result is now clear: the family clears every deterministic gate, but the required hardening verdict remains unavailable because quota expired mid-ladder. The valid oracle evidence is still useful—easy was solved 3/3 and medium 2/2 before the failure—but it cannot justify shipping hard. I’m updating the machine-readable report and README to distinguish those valid solves from the shipping-preset arms, which are all 0 valid attempts plus four HTTP 403 errors each.
