codex
Implemented a self-contained Track B generator based on Section 6 and Theorem 1 of the [paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2010.08281).

Key results:

- All deterministic gates G1–G9(c) pass.
- Shipping space has exactly \(128/2^{127}=2^{-120}\) valid answers.
- Five heuristic attacks succeeded 0/8 times each.
